    comment "en" """
        Source V6210 = Swedish extension of V62.1 (passenger of heavy transport vehicle, nontraffic,
        collision with two-/three-wheeled MV) subdivided by sport/exercise. The V62.1 Athena crosswalk
        yields 437738 + 444074. Target 437738 (214640008). Collision-partner specificity, passenger
        role, and activity dimension uncovered → partial. Moderate tier.
        """
