mapping "V6211.1" source="V6211" target="214640008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6211 SNOMED CT 214640008 36198007 is a Swedish ICD-10-SE 5-character extension of base
        ICD-10 V62.1. The SE code adds an activity-context suffix (sport/work/leisure/etc.) that has no
        SNOMED CT representation; the clinical injury event is identical to the parent. Athena crosswalk
        from V62.1 verifies two standard (standard_concept=S) SNOMED CT targets: 437738 (Motor vehicle
        accident off public road) and 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident). Primary
        437738 is the more specific standard concept matching the nontraffic/boarding context; secondary
        444074 is the broader standard ancestor also in the crosswalk. mapping_type=broader because the
        target subsumes the source's vehicle-injury meaning while the source's activity-context detail
        has no standard representation. : clearly correct, one-level breadth mismatch with a verified
        Athena crosswalk.
        """
}
mapping "V6211.2" source="V6211" target="36198007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
}
